                        target="frus1929v01#pg_345">345</ref>–<ref target="frus1929v01#pg_346"
                        >346</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d670-f2" n="97" xml:id="d670-f2-content">
                <p>The substance of this telegram was communicated to the People’s Commissariat for
                    Foreign Affairs by the Embassy in the Soviet Union in a note of August 23
                    (711.94114 Mail/25).</p>
            </note>
